gnostics\",\n","        \"differential_diagnosis\",\n","        \"management_and_clinical_course\",\n","    ]:\n","        v = case.get(k, \"\")\n","        if v and v != \"not reported\":\n","            parts.append(v.strip())\n","    return \" \".join(parts)\n","\n","def safe_generate(prompt, max_retries=5):\n","    for attempt in range(max_retries):\n","        try:\n","            return model.generate_content(prompt)\n","        except exceptions.ResourceExhausted:\n","            print(\"Quota exceeded, waiting 30s...\")\n","            time.sleep(30)\n","        except Exception as e:\n","            print(f\"Gen Error (attempt {attempt}): {e}\")\n","            time.sleep(5)\n","    raise RuntimeError(\"Max retries exceeded\")\n","\n","def generate_demographics(disease_name: str) -> str:\n","    prompt = DEMOGRAPHIC_SAMPLER_PROMPT.replace(\"<DISEASE>\", disease_name)\n","    resp = safe_generate(prompt)\n","    return resp.text.replace(\"DEMOGRAPHIC:\", \"\").strip()\n","\n","def extract_json(text: str) -> dict:\n","    match = re.search(r\"\\{[\\s\\S]*\\}\", text)\n","    if not match:\n","        raise ValueError(\"No JSON object found in model output\")\n","    return json.loads(match.group())\n","\n","def make_qa_prompt(case_id, scenario, disease_name, source_filename):\n","    prompt = f\"\"\"\n","You are an expert clinician-educator. Your task is to transform raw clinical data\n","into a high-quality Diagnostic QA pair with a detailed Clinical Rationale (Chain-of-Thought).\n","\n","You MUST FIRST generate a patient DEMOGRAPHIC description by strictly following the instructions below.\n","You MUST internally generate the DEMOGRAPHIC exactly according to these rules,\n","but you must NOT output it as a separate field.\n","Instead, you must integrate the demographic information naturally into the clinical vignette.\n","\n","### DEMOGRAPHIC GENERATION INSTRUCTIONS (DO NOT MODIFY):\n","{DEMOGRAPHIC_SAMPLER_PROMPT.replace(\"<DISEASE>\", disease_name)}\n","\